<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BPI to issue H1 results Weds.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BPI to issue H1 results Weds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Portugues de Investimento will issue its results for first half 1997 after 1700 GMT today, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>He could not give a firm time.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
